text Even so... he's up.
text Alone, drinking...
text I ignore him and try to pass straight in front of him.
sound 03C.aac
text @[Voice]
text Tomoya-kun.
text ...He calls my name.
sound 03D.aac
text @[Voice]
text Hey, Tomoya-kun.
text He calls my name again when I don't stand still.
text If I don't listen to what he wants now, he might follow me to my room. My only choice is to stop.
text @[Tomoya]
text What do you want...?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNY10"
