sound 03F.aac
text @[Father]
text Did you make this in art class...?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 03G.aac
text @[Father]
text It's cute.
text He strokes its rugged surface.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Idiot.
sound 03H.aac
text @[Father]
text Hm?
text @[Tomoya]
text Of course I didn't make that.
sound 03I.aac
text @[Father]
text Oh... I guess you wouldn't...
sound 03J.aac
text @[Father]
text It is awfully cute...
sound 03K.aac
text @[Father]
text So, what is it, then?
text @[Tomoya]
text Someone just handed it to me...
sound 03L.aac
text @[Father]
text A friend?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
sound 03M.aac
text @[Father]
text Well, we should take good care of it, in that case.
text You want us to share it...?
text I shudder at the thought.
text @[Tomoya]
text You can have it...
text So I tell him that.
sound 03N.aac
text @[Father]
text What, really? Is that all right?
text He sounds happy.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, it's yours. Do whatever you want with it.
sound 03O.aac
text @[Father]
text Okay... I'll take good care of it, then. For the both of us!
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text He seems to be done with me.
